OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Aestranged wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams denied murder and was
OL,7,Fconvicted at Norwich Crown Court
OL,8,Ffollowing a 17-day trial.
